algorithms.pseudocode:
function approximateFreeRightEdge(mu, sigma, left, right, k):
    if k = 0: return (left + right) / 2
    mid = (left + right) / 2
    target = 1 / sigma^2
    if f_mu(mid) > target:
        return approximateFreeRightEdge(mu, sigma, mid, right, k-1)
    else:
        return approximateFreeRightEdge(mu, sigma, left, mid, k-1)

Convergence: O(k * |atoms|) time, interval halves each step.
Correctness: Verified in Lean 4 (approximateFreeRightEdge_in_interval).
